  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">Republic of Hanover\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Germany\" title=\"Germany\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Flag of Germany\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e6/Flag_of_Germany.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150815025838\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Germany.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Germany.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2112–2139</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"European Association\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/12/European_Association.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20170817172319\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"European Association.png\" data-image-key=\"European_Association.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/f/f2/Flag_of_Hanover.png/revision/latest?cb=20171015040005\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Hanover\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/f/f2/Flag_of_Hanover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20171015040005\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Hanover.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Hanover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hanover</strong>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Unitary parliamentary republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>Legislature\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Upper house\n</td>\n<td>Bundesrat\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Lower house\n</td>\n<td>Bundestag\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2112\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Dissolution\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">September 16, 2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\">European Association</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Hanover, </b>officially the<b> Republic of Hanover</b>, was a sovereign nation&#160;located in Central Europe that would end up participating in the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a>. Created after the dissolution of Germany, Hanover bordered Denmark to the north, Netherlands to the west, Bradenburg to the east, Saxony to the southeast, and Rhineland to the south. The main ethnic group of Hanover were German's, with small populative pockets of Dutch and Danish. The main religion is Protestantism and Christianity, with a plurality of Islamic and generally non-religious citizens. The official language of Hanover is German.&#160;\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205801\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 868/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8454/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1295/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 14/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639893/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   71.488      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   71.488      1 -total\n 60.04%   42.924      2 Template:Ns0\n 55.35%   39.566      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 23.65%   16.908      2 Template:Str_find\n  3.23%    2.309      2 Template:Ordinal\n  2.58%    1.845      1 Template:Both\n  2.11%    1.511      2 Template:!!\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:2209-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205801 and revision id 6746. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
